      "description": "The black sign band: condensed trip name, facts, inverted button, and the day strip map.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-band\"><div class=\"ds-band-top\"><div><h1 class=\"ds-band-name\">Japan 2027</h1><p class=\"ds-band-facts\">Sat, Apr 10 to Sun, Apr 18 · 9 days · Tokyo, Kyoto</p></div><button class=\"ds-band-btn\">Add to trip</button></div><ol class=\"ds-strip\"><li><a class=\"ds-strip-bullet\" style=\"background:#0072B2;color:#fff\" href=\"#\">1</a><span class=\"ds-strip-seg\" style=\"background:#0072B2\"></span></li><li><a class=\"ds-strip-bullet\" style=\"background:#E69F00;color:#121417\" href=\"#\">2</a><span class=\"ds-strip-seg\" style=\"background:#E69F00\"></span></li><li><a class=\"ds-strip-bullet\" style=\"background:#009E73;color:#121417\" href=\"#\">3</a></li></ol></header>",
      "css": ".ds-band{background:#121417;color:#fff;padding:24px 32px 20px;font-family:Archivo,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;} .ds-band-top{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px 32px;} .ds-band-name{margin:0;font-size:48px;line-height:1;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.025em;font-stretch:condensed;} .ds-band-facts{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:#b9bec4;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;} .ds-band-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid transparent;font:500 14px/1 Archivo,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s;background:#fff;color:#121417;} .ds-band-btn:hover{background:rgb(255 255 255/.85);} .ds-band-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:2px;} .ds-strip{display:flex;list-style:none;margin:20px 0 0;padding:0;} .ds-strip li{display:flex;flex:1;align-items:center;} .ds-strip li:last-child{flex:none;} .ds-strip-bullet{display:flex;width:32px;height:32px;margin:6px;border-radius:9999px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #121417;transition:transform .15s;position:relative;z-index:1;} .ds-strip-bullet:hover{transform:scale(1.1);} .ds-strip-bullet:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:4px;} .ds-strip-seg{flex:1;height:4px;min-width:16px;margin:0 -12px;}"
